    "authoring_log": {
      "manual_decisions": [
        "Revise the accepted v1 snow-garden as a new v2 folder; keep v1 byte-for-byte untouched.",
        "Keep the same closed 20x16 orthogonal footprint, snow floor and spawn; no sockets or connectivity.",
        "Increase trees from eight to eighteen with varied heights, radii and branch/canopy variants, all static.",
        "Add ten decorative snow drifts, twelve marker posts, wall caps/posts/base strips, a detailed bench and a static angel-stone prop from the seed frame.",
        "Add a second cool fill light and warm key light plus tuned ambient/background energy; the PSX shaders are unshaded so dusk colour is baked into authored albedo values.",
        "Extract five direct crops of frame_4347 with the existing crop tool; use solid-color PSX materials for snow, hedge and trunks.",
        "Retain the accepted controller and PSX profile; leave both calibration flags false."
      ],
